  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For a magnetic dipole placed in a uniform magnetic field, the torque is given by <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>&#964;</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, and potential energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi></math> is given as,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br /><br />When <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is in the same direction as <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> then <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>&#964;</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi></math> is minimum = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></math> as <math><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math>.<math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Stable equilibrium is (b).</p><p>When <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> the opposite direction of <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, then <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>&#964;</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi></math> is max = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></math><br />As,&nbsp;<math><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>180</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>Unstable equilibrium in (d)</p>"
  }
